            {
                "parameters": {
                    "promptType": "define",
                    "text": "=You are a career professional, who can help me to create a list of my key achievements based on my previous work experience and the job I am applying for. You have to create a list of relevant key achievements in german and output it in this json format:\n{\n\"key_achievements\":[\n{\n\"description\": \"a detailed description of my key achievement that highlichts why I am perfect for the job I am applying for\",\n\"company\": \"the name of the company, where I achieved this key achievement\",\n\"reason\": \"the reason why you think this would be a key achievement I should add to my resume\"\n}\n]\n\nThe definition of a key achievement: \n\nThey are highlighted, standout accomplishments that had a significant impact.\nThey are often more quantifiable or strategic like:\n\"Increased sales by 30% in Q3 through targeted marketing.\"\n\"Led a team of 5 engineers to deliver a product 2 months ahead of schedule.\"\n\nIt is crutial that they are relevant to the job I am applying for. Highly relevant key achievements will be rewarded. Non relevant key achievements will be penalised.\nYou also must not add any key achievements I already have in my list. The key achievements already on my list are: {{ $json.key_achievements.map(a => a.description) }}\n\nthe description of the job I am applying for:\n\"{{ $json.applications[0].content }}\"\n\nmy job experience summarized in my own words and formatted into a json structure, where the property \"from\" represents the month and year I started the job, the property \"to\" represents the month and year I quit the job, the property \"description\" represents the description of the job, what I did and what I achieved,\nthe property \"company\" represents the name of the company, the property \"location\" represents the name of the city I worked in, and the property \"title\" represents the official position I had at this job: \n\n\"{{ $json.jobs.toJsonString() }}\"\n\nYou have to output only the json and nothing else. Adding additional text that would prevent me from parsing the json will result in a penalty. You also have to avoid the use of fancy words like \"spearheaded\". Including those words will result in a penalty.",
                    "hasOutputParser": true,
                    "options": {}
                },
